lyoc:{t:"indicative",s:"Higg MSI gives 3.16 kg CO₂e per kg for TENCEL lyocell but no step breakdown. Shares here are indicative.",u:"https://tencel.com/images/assets/claims/document/claim-proof-tencel-lyocell-fiber-snapshot-202410.pdf"},
