wet:{t:"partly",s:"Apparel Impact Institute / GEI thermal roadmap: fabric prep, dyeing and finishing use over 50% of a mill’s thermal energy; steam is 50–60% and hot oil 30–40% of fuel; distribution losses can reach 35%. The step split is indicative.",u:"https://apparelimpact.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Low-Carbon-Thermal-Roadmap-Aii-and-GEI.pdf"},
